@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@authToken = Bearer eyJhbGciOi...

### Obtener Cuestionario Activo (Onboarding)
GET {{baseUrl}}/questionnaire/active?kind=ONBOARDING
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Guardar Respuestas del Cuestionario (Alumno autenticado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/questionnaire/save
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": [
    {
      "id": "p1_interes_area",
      "category": "INTERESES",
      "value": "Desarrollo de Software e Inteligencia Artificial"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2_modalidad_trabajo",
      "category": "EXPECTATIVAS",
      "value": "Remoto"
    },
    {
      "id": "p3_nivel_programacion",
      "category": "HABILIDADES",
      "value": 4
    }
  ]
}

### Consultar Respuestas del Alumno Autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/questionnaire/my-answers
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Consultar Historial de Envíos del Alumno
GET {{baseUrl}}/questionnaire/my-responses
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Listar Catálogo de Cuestionarios (Admin / Analyst)
GET {{baseUrl}}/questionnaire/catalog
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Crear Nuevo Cuestionario (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/questionnaire
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "CHECK_IN",
  "version": 1,
  "active": true
}

### Agregar Pregunta a Cuestionario (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/questionnaire/QUESTIONNAIRE_UUID_HERE/questions
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "p_satisfaccion_general",
  "position": 1,
  "text": "¿Cómo calificarías tu satisfacción general con el semestre?",
  "type": "SCALE",
  "required": true,
  "category": "EXPECTATIVAS"
}

### Agregar Opción a Pregunta (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/questionnaire/questions/QUESTION_UUID_HERE/options
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": "5",
  "label": "Muy Satisfecho",
  "position": 1
}
